        "content": "你知不知道自己在干什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 185,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 186,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]我在阻止萨卡兹！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "我在阻止萨卡兹！"
    },
    {
        "id": 187,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 188,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]你在胡闹。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "你在胡闹。"
    },
    {
        "id": 189,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 190,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]我都计划好了，不会连累你们，我会告诉萨卡兹是我干的，然后——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "我都计划好了，不会连累你们，我会告诉萨卡兹是我干的，然后——"
    },
    {
        "id": 191,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#3$1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 192,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]——然后死在萨卡兹手上。你把自己当成英雄了，是不是？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "——然后死在萨卡兹手上。你把自己当成英雄了，是不是？"
    },
    {
        "id": 193,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#3$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 194,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]我会试着逃走。我计划了很久——",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "我会试着逃走。我计划了很久——"
    },
    {
        "id": 195,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 196,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]用你改造过的爬行者。你想藏在货运线路里，逃出海布里区。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "用你改造过的爬行者。你想藏在货运线路里，逃出海布里区。"
    },
    {
        "id": 197,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#11$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 198,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]你都知道......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "你都知道......"
    },
    {
        "id": 199,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#11$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#11$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 200,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]我在这片厂区生活了五十多年，你想干的蠢事还瞒不过我的眼睛。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "我在这片厂区生活了五十多年，你想干的蠢事还瞒不过我的眼睛。"
    },
    {
        "id": 201,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 202,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]奶奶，听我说。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "奶奶，听我说。"
    },
    {
        "id": 203,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]我收到了一些消息，有一个反抗组织正在萨迪恩区活跃。他们从萨卡兹手底下救出来了不少人，甚至成功夺回了几个地块！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "我收到了一些消息，有一个反抗组织正在萨迪恩区活跃。他们从萨卡兹手底下救出来了不少人，甚至成功夺回了几个地块！"
    },
    {
        "id": 204,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]他们管自己叫伦蒂尼姆市民自救军——我要去找他们！",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "他们管自己叫伦蒂尼姆市民自救军——我要去找他们！"
    },
    {
        "id": 205,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#6$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 206,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]......找他们。",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "......找他们。"
    },
    {
        "id": 207,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]找到之后呢？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "找到之后呢？"
    },
    {
        "id": 208,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#2$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 209,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]呃......什么？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "呃......什么？"
    },
    {
        "id": 210,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#2$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 211,
        "raw": "[name=\"凯瑟琳\"]他们缺工匠吗？你要替他们组装自动化生产流水线，还是设计下一代爬行者？",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "凯瑟琳",
        "content": "他们缺工匠吗？你要替他们组装自动化生产流水线，还是设计下一代爬行者？"
    },
    {
        "id": 212,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_402_1#4$1\",name2=\"avg_npc_648_1#8$1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_648_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 213,
        "raw": "[name=\"费斯特\"]我......",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "费斯特",
        "content": "我......"
    },
